      "content": "\"letting go of the weight\"... i don't know. it sounds almost poetic, but in reality it just feels impossible. every time i try to slow down, the pressure builds up again. like, if i stop, everything collapses. but then i think, what's actually left to collapse? everything i've built is just... empty. it's all just noise. i feel like if i could just find some actual silence, i could finally breathe.",
